@@section 1
@@title SQ-WGE Worldgen edit plan, built part, 2026-11-02 ([plan_worldgen_edit.md](../plan_worldgen_edit.md) A1 to A5, B1, B5; TODO `worldgen/biomes #9`, `locate #5`, `earthfill #4`, `rates-and-groups #6 #9 #11 #12`, `seasons #2`)
@@phase worldgen
@@date 2026-11-02
@@jars creativeworldgen
@@sources feature_writeup/plan_worldgen_edit.md
@@text
@@text Rewritten in depth 2026-11-02 (one row per changed value, each with a before/after number to compare). Targets: Creative Common
@@text 1.1.07 and Creative Calendar 1.0.0 installed in `mods/` 2026-11-02 00:18 or later, plus the same-day data / config edits
@@text (`pool_config.json`, `structure_groups.json`, `structure_tags.json`, `biome_config.json`, `waystones-common.toml`,
@@text `creativeengineering-common.toml`; the scratch server needs `waystones-common.toml` copied from `config/`, `prep_srv.sh`
@@text does not carry it). Fresh normal world (group B) for every worldgen row; seed 8675309 so numbers compare with SQ-WG30.
@@text Rows 00b to 18 (added 2026-11-02 late) cover steps 3 to 5: A6, A7, B2 to B4, C3 to C6, N1 to N11; they need the Creative Worldgen jar from the wave 5 carve (B2 punch, C6 meteorite heights; Creative Common no longer holds worldgen) and `end_divers.js`. Not queued: B6 (no rule built, owner call), C1 (runs inside the scratch session as SQ-TER-05), N2 and N3 (already in SQ-PSW).
@@text Order: 00 (offline, no boot), then one group B boot for 01 to 05 and 08, one group A boot for 06, one client session for 07.
